        <p><seg source="#source-9401-9416">（わん。）</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9416-9437"><rb>津島</rb><rt>つしま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9437-9443">ぶ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9443-9467"><rb>隱元</rb><rt>いんげん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9467-9479">、きす、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9479-9503"><rb>鳥肉</rb><rt>とりにく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9503-9509">。（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9509-9524"><rb>鉢</rb><rt>はち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9524-9548">。）たひさしみ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9548-9572"><rb>新菊</rb><rt>しんぎく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9572-9575">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9575-9587"><rb>葉</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9587-9590">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9590-9605"><rb>甘</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9605-9611">だい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9611-9632"><rb>二切</rb><rt>ふたき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9632-9641">れ。（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9641-9656"><rb>鉢</rb><rt>はち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9656-9683">。）えびしんじよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9683-9698"><rb>銀</rb><rt>ぎん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9698-9722">なん、かぶ、つゆ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9722-9746"><rb>澤山</rb><rt>だくさん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9746-9749">。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9749-9770"><rb>土瓶</rb><rt>どびん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9770-9776">むし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9776-9791"><rb>松</rb><rt>まつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9791-9824">だけ。つけもの、かぶ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9824-9842"><rb>奈良</rb><rt>なら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9842-9878">づけ。かごにて、ぶだう、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9878-9893"><rb>梨</r