        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-20197-20206">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20206-20221"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20221-20257">だつけか、あとだつたか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20257-20284"><rb>春葉</rb><rt>しゆんえふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20284-20287">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20287-20302"><rb>相</rb><rt>あひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20302-20329">ひとしく、まぐろの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20329-20356"><rb>中脂</rb><rt>ちうあぶら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20356-20374">を、おろしで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20374-20386"><rb>和</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20386-20395">へて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20395-20416"><rb>醤油</rb><rt>したぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20416-20419">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20419-20431"><rb>注</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20431-20440">いで、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20440-20470"><rb>令夫人</rb><rt>れいふじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20470-20476">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20476-20497"><rb>給仕</rb><rt>きふじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20497-20506">つきの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20506-20527"><rb>御飯</rb><rt>ごはん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20527-20545">へのつけて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20545-20560"><rb>熱</rb><rt>あつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20560-20563">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20563-20578"><rb>茶</rb><rt>ちや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20578-20581">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-20581-20593"><rb>打</rb><rt>ぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-20593-20620">つかけて、さくさく</seg><choice source="#source-20620-20626"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-20626-20647